Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:21:06 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] test(smgr): add test_smgr_hooks module

Add a test module that installs the smgr read, write and extend hooks and
XORs the blocks of user relations with a per-block key.  The TAP test
checks that data is stored transformed, read back correctly, survives
crash recovery and is rejected when the module is not loaded.
