diff --git a/src/test/modules/test_smgr_hooks/README b/src/test/modules/test_smgr_hooks/README
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..6b5847e253f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/test/modules/test_smgr_hooks/README
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+test_smgr_hooks
+===============
+
+Test module for the smgr I/O transformation hooks (smgr_read_hook,
+smgr_write_hook and smgr_extend_hook).
+
+The module XORs the blocks of user relations with a per-block key byte when
+they are written and reverses it when they are read.  This is not a cipher;
+it only makes the on-disk image differ from the in-memory image so that the
+tests can tell whether the hooks are called on every path.
+
+The module must be loaded with shared_preload_libraries, and only
+relations created after initdb (relNumber >= FirstNormalObjectId) are
+transformed, because initdb runs without the module.
